{
  "_comment": [
    "Reduced E5a screening matrix: five file-size/connection conditions, each on all four mechanisms; 5 repetitions.",
    "Retained: 4 KiB at 1, 100, and 1000 connections; 64 KiB at 10; 1 MiB at 100. The 1000-connection result is a boundary probe; rejected runs remain failures/unsupported, not measurements.",
